WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:23.429
"Hello, The mayor spoke loudly into his cell phone.

2
00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:25.270
"Mayor Hubbletree here.

3
00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:30.154
I need you to send twenty pizzas over to Monster Academy as fast as you can.

4
00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:34.769
What? Yes, of course it's safe to come over here."

5
00:00:35.989 --> 00:00:37.650
The mayor listened for a moment.

6
00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:41.552
"No, Enzo, none of the monsters will try to eat you.

7
00:00:41.912 --> 00:00:43.272
Just bring those pizzas!"

8
00:00:44.873 --> 00:00:46.514
The mayor put his cell phone away.

9
00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:54.417
All the monster students started eating their pizza while the humans waited for theirs to arrive.

10
00:00:56.558 --> 00:01:01.740
Ben looked around the cafeteria and was surprised to see Deb standing with her back to the wall.

11
00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:07.245
"I guess the office ogre found her," he thought.

12
00:01:07.265 --> 00:01:10.026
"Over here, Ben!"

13
00:01:10.446 --> 00:01:12.407
called Waldo from a nearby table.

14
00:01:13.248 --> 00:01:15.228
Gaby, Dave, and Jen were with him.

15
00:01:16.489 --> 00:01:18.190
Ben floated over to his friends.

16
00:01:22.131 --> 00:01:23.852
pizza looks great," he said.

17
00:01:24.932 --> 00:01:27.193
Then he glanced at Dave, who looked ill.

18
00:01:27.213 --> 00:01:31.355
"Sorry you don't like it."

19
00:01:31.375 --> 00:01:33.736
"I-it's okay," said Dave.

20
00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.321
"The regular pizza will be here soon."

21
00:01:37.361 --> 00:01:39.422
Jen grabbed a slice and took a bite.

22
00:01:39.442 --> 00:01:44.344
"Mmm! The worm guts are so slippery!

23
00:01:44.844 --> 00:01:47.125
Are you sure you don't want to try it, Dave?"

24
00:01:48.226 --> 00:01:49.406
Dave held up a hand.

25
00:01:49.426 --> 00:01:50.767
"No, thanks.

26
00:01:50.927 --> 00:01:51.427
I'm fine."

27
00:01:51.447 --> 00:01:55.288
"I love pond scum," said Gaby.

28
00:01:55.308 --> 00:01:57.129
"I put it on everything!"

29
00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.371
Mr. Freaky was apologizing again.

30
00:02:00.391 --> 00:02:03.752
"I'm really sorry about lunch, Mayor.

31
00:02:04.608 --> 00:02:07.310
I hope you're enjoying some parts of the field trip."

32
00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:08.890
"Are you kidding?"

33
00:02:09.251 --> 00:02:10.291
said Mayor Hubbletree.

34
00:02:10.311 --> 00:02:13.633
"This field trip is a complete disaster!"

35
00:02:14.814 --> 00:02:17.955
Mr. Freaky took out his handkerchief and blew his noses.

36
00:02:20.096 --> 00:02:22.738
Thirty minutes later the other pizzas arrived.

37
00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:27.480
The human kids cheered as the deliveryman entered the cafeteria.

38
00:02:30.822 --> 00:02:33.864
The deliveryman looked nervously around the cafeteria.

39
00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:41.564
"I h-have t-twenty pizzas here for—" Boom!

40
00:02:42.124 --> 00:02:47.347
The pizzas exploded, sending cheese and tomato sauce all over the cafeteria.

41
00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:51.789
At the same moment, Ben spied someone running out the door.

42
00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.650
It was a squid monster.

43
00:02:54.411 --> 00:02:56.172
Ben didn't recognize the monster.

44
00:02:56.912 --> 00:02:59.153
But he did recognize what she was wearing.

45
00:02:59.173 --> 00:03:03.115
"A hoodie with a green skull on the back!"

46
00:03:03.615 --> 00:03:04.136
thought Ben.

47
00:03:05.204 --> 00:03:08.886
Why were the mystery girl and the squid monster wearing the same thing?

48
00:03:10.147 --> 00:03:11.327
Were they part of a gang?

49
00:03:12.988 --> 00:03:15.790
Mayor Hubbletree stared at the pizza explosion.

50
00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:19.091
"What is wrong with this school?"

51
00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:19.892
he said.

52
00:03:21.313 --> 00:03:23.954
Mr. Freaky had his face buried in his hands.

53
00:03:24.474 --> 00:03:25.935
He was moaning loudly.

54
00:03:31.118 --> 00:03:36.109
A cafeteria troll came out of the kitchen with a mop and a bucket, and began to clean

55
00:03:36.189 --> 00:03:36.829
up the mess.

56
00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:41.152
Mayor Hubbletree went over to the deliveryman.

57
00:03:42.533 --> 00:03:44.134
The deliveryman was shaking.

58
00:03:44.154 --> 00:03:48.097
"I-I'm sorry, sir," he said.

59
00:03:48.117 --> 00:03:50.158
"I don't know what happened."

60
00:03:51.219 --> 00:03:53.580
"It's not your fault," said the mayor.

61
00:03:54.861 --> 00:03:56.562
He glanced around at the monsters.

62
00:03:56.582 --> 00:04:01.126
"It's this place—strange things happen here.

63
00:04:01.986 --> 00:04:04.488
Go back to the restaurant and get another twenty pizzas.

64
00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:09.281
And don't worry—the principal here will be paying for everything."

65
00:04:11.022 --> 00:04:13.262
The deliveryman left the cafeteria.

66
00:04:14.523 --> 00:04:15.643
Waldo shook his head.

67
00:04:16.423 --> 00:04:18.484
"Wow, what a strange day.

68
00:04:19.204 --> 00:04:20.864
What made those pizzas explode?"

69
00:04:20.884 --> 00:04:23.765
"I'm not sure," said Ben.

70
00:04:23.785 --> 00:04:26.226
"But I think it was a squid monster.

71
00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:30.567
And I think she and the girl who attacked you are in a gang together."

72
00:04:32.087 --> 00:04:33.988
"What?" Waldo raised an eyebrow.

73
00:04:34.848 --> 00:04:35.609
"What do you mean?"

74
00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:40.172
Ben explained all the odd things he'd seen that day.

75
00:04:40.192 --> 00:04:42.494
"You should tell Mr.

76
00:04:42.574 --> 00:04:45.456
Freaky about the squid monster," said Waldo.

77
00:04:45.476 --> 00:04:48.798
"Maybe he can stop the gang from ruining the field trip.

78
00:04:48.819 --> 00:04:50.520
Otherwise Mayor Hubbletree might decide to bulldoze the school for real this time."

79
00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:51.280
Ben nodded and got up from the table.

80
00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:55.403
He floated over to the principal, who was standing with Mayor Hubbletree and Ms.

81
00:04:55.483 --> 00:04:57.045
Prim. "Mr.

82
00:04:57.125 --> 00:04:58.506
Freaky," said Ben.

83
00:04:58.526 --> 00:05:01.308
"I think I know who made the pizzas explode."

84
00:05:01.996 --> 00:05:02.717
The principal's eyes went wide.

85
00:05:02.737 --> 00:05:03.337
"Who?" he demanded.

86
00:05:03.357 --> 00:05:03.897
"Tell me at once!"

87
00:05:03.917 --> 00:05:04.858
"It was a squid monster," said Ben.

88
00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:06.459
"I think the monster is part of a gang."

89
00:05:06.479 --> 00:05:08.340
"Aha!" declared Mayor Hubbletree.

90
00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:12.642
"You monsters are finally admitting that a monster is the culprit!

91
00:05:13.783 --> 00:05:16.544
I knew a human student wasn't causing problems."

92
00:05:17.845 --> 00:05:18.866
He stared at Mr.

93
00:05:18.906 --> 00:05:21.007
Freaky. "Well, Freaky?

94
00:05:21.367 --> 00:05:22.788
What are you going to do about this?"

95
00:05:24.029 --> 00:05:26.170
The principal started wringing his hands.

96
00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:30.948
"Oh, where is Miss Bungle?"

97
00:05:30.968 --> 00:05:31.869
"I'm right here!"

98
00:05:32.449 --> 00:05:35.150
called the broom flying teacher, hurrying over.

99
00:05:37.391 --> 00:05:40.392
Mr. Freaky told Miss Bungle about the squid monster.

100
00:05:42.853 --> 00:05:46.355
Miss Bungle hurried out of the cafeteria to search for the monster.

101
00:05:48.275 --> 00:05:50.096
After several minutes she returned.

102
00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:55.218
"I used every kind of seeking spell I know," she said.

103
00:05:55.238 --> 00:05:59.360
"There are no squid monsters anywhere in the building."

104
00:06:01.164 --> 00:06:02.725
She looked out over the students.

105
00:06:02.745 --> 00:06:07.107
"Except Beth and Henry, who are sitting over there."

106
00:06:08.848 --> 00:06:10.689
Ben knew those two squid monsters.

107
00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.011
Neither was the one he'd seen run out of the cafeteria.

108
00:06:15.972 --> 00:06:18.994
Mr. Freaky took out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

109
00:06:24.796 --> 00:06:26.539
"This is terrible!

110
00:06:27.461 --> 00:06:30.707
First we had a mystery human running loose in the school.

111
00:06:31.688 --> 00:06:34.473
Now we have a mystery squid monster!"
